text-to-cad (the project this one reimplements)
Copyright (c) 2026 Thompson Labs LLC. MIT licence: see LICENSE-text-to-cad.
https://github.com/earthtojake/text-to-cad

This repository is a reimplementation in Rust and TypeScript of text-to-cad's workflow and
command-line surface. Material adapted from text-to-cad, and therefore covered by its notice:
  - the structure, wording and checklists of the agent skills in skills/ (cad, fea, pcb,
    render, robot-simulation, and the manufacturing and drawing references), rewritten for this
    tool's commands;
  - the test scenarios and expected values ported from its test suite (docs/test-port.md lists
    each original test file and what became of it);
  - the shape of the HTTP/CLI contract and the reference grammar (docs/api.md, docs/cli.md),
    redesigned for this implementation;
  - the plugin and installer layout (scripts/install, the plugin manifests).
No source code was copied from text-to-cad's Python or JavaScript packages.
